<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for an eleventh tranche of 2.0 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 7.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   November 1, 2006   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.20 pct vs	6.49 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.17 pct vs	7.47 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  104.85   vs    102.80</p>
<p> Bids		 3.359 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The previous auction was of a ninth tranche of the 10-year, 7.75 percent BTPs on December 30.</p>
</text>
